t 12, the record for Hyde County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair, and it was 70% of normal in 2025. This year so far, March to April came in at 51% of normal in 2026 on the middle of the grids. Grid 18817 had its driest year in 2001 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
